      "fact": "In United States v. Keller (9th Cir. 2021), the panel held that the administrative exhaustion requirement in 18 U.S.C. § 3582(c)(1)(A)(i) is a mandatory claim-processing rule that a district court must enforce when properly invoked by the government.",
