{
  "evidence": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "fact": "In Rudisill v. McDonough, the Supreme Court granted certiorari on June 26, 2023, to resolve a dispute over whether a veteran with separate entitlements to both the Montgomery GI Bill and the Post-9/11 GI Bill is subject to a 36-month aggregate cap or a 48-month aggregate cap.",
