      "id": 1,
      "fact": "In Terrell v. Main Line Health, Inc., 320 F.Supp.3d 644 (E.D.Pa. 2018), the court granted summary judgment for the employer because the plaintiff failed to raise a triable issue of fact regarding whether the proffered nondiscriminatory reason for termination was pretextual.",
